BEGIN_HYPERDESC
<h1>Transfer planning: gravity assists</h1>
A delta-glider in a 300 km Earth orbit in February 2023. The script plans a
route to Mars by a Venus flyby (patched conics, then each encounter targeted
in full gravity) and searches routes to Jupiter with up to three flybys.
END_HYPERDESC

BEGIN_ENVIRONMENT
  System Sol
  Date MJD 60000.0
  Script Tests/RoutePlanTest
END_ENVIRONMENT

BEGIN_FOCUS
  Ship GL-R
END_FOCUS

BEGIN_CAMERA
  TARGET GL-R
  MODE Extern
  POS 4 0 -20
  TRACKMODE TargetRelative
  FOV 50.00
END_CAMERA

BEGIN_SHIPS
GL-R:DeltaGlider
  STATUS Orbiting Earth
  ELEMENTS 6671000.0 0.00000 28.5 0.0 0.0 0.0 60000.0
  AROT 0 0 0
  PRPLEVEL 0:1.000 1:1.000
END
END_SHIPS
